'''Critical Poison''' is a round 3 hybrid [[Skill]] available to both the [[Ranger]] and [[Reaper]]. It grants {{icon/poison}} critical chance based on {{icon/luck}}, and inflicts {{icon/poison}} based on the damage dealt by the {{icon/star}} [[weapon]].

Critical Poison is particularly strong with [[Belladonna's Whisper]], as the effects become a circular loop. Critical Poison will apply additional {{icon/poison}} for damage that is greater than 5, making poison increase over time massively.

